    "text": "waovam.com\nwebsite\nDennis Quaid says ‘every day is paradise’ with wife 39 years his junior\n2 days ago\nDennis Quaid is living the dream. It’s been five years since the “Sovereign” star, 71, married Laura Savoie, 32, and he’s still firmly in the honeymoon stage. “My life is paradise,” Quaid told Fox News Digital when asked what he loves most about his wife. “Every day is paradise with her. It really is.”",
